---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro";
import AssetImage from "@/components/AssetImage.astro";
---

<Base title="Team | Global Enterprise" description="Meet the senior practitioners and disciplines that make up the Global Enterprise model." keywords={["enterprise consulting team", "strategy practitioners", "technology transformation leaders", "organizational capability"]}>
  <section class="bg-paper py-20 md:py-28"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-end"><div><p class="eyebrow">The team</p><h1 class="section-title mt-7 max-w-5xl">Senior thinking, close to the work.</h1><p class="body-copy mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl">Global Enterprise brings together the disciplines that complex change needs: strategy, operations, technology, research, and organizational capability.</p></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink"><AssetImage src="/media/generated/education-future.avif" width={1536} height={1024} loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="A diverse group collaborating in a modern learning space" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover opacity-90" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site"><SectionHeading eyebrow="How we are organized" title="The right people for the real question." /><div class="mt-14 grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-2">{[{n:"Strategy",t:"Strategy & operating model",d:"Frame the mandate, choices, decision rights, and measures that give the work direction."},{n:"Technology",t:"Architecture & technology",d:"Connect cloud, data, automation, and enterprise platforms to the outcomes they need to support."},{n:"Foresight",t:"Research & foresight",d:"Bring market, policy, customer, and technology signals into high-consequence decisions."},{n:"Capability",t:"Leadership & capability",d:"Help teams build the culture, habits, and capability required to sustain a new way of working."}].map((role) => <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12"><span class="font-display text-2xl text-cobalt">{role.n}</span><h2 class="mt-16 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]">{role.t}</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted">{role.d}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">The senior bench</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5">Close enough to the work to see what the slide deck misses.</h2></div><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>We bring the level of experience the problem requires, from executive framing through the architecture review, service blueprint, operating rhythm, and change adoption that make the decision real.</p><p>Our work has included enterprise AI advisory, solution strategy for federal agencies, healthcare operating change, and ITIL change management across a decade of service transformation. We are comfortable where disciplines overlap because that is where the hard decisions tend to live.</p><p>The team model is deliberately interdisciplinary. One lead holds the narrative; the right specialists come close to the decision; capability is transferred as the work moves.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="bg-ink text-white"><div class="container-site flex flex-col gap-8 py-16 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><h2 class="max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.05em]">We are always interested in thoughtful operators.</h2><a class="btn-primary" href="/careers/">Explore careers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
